# GMS: 225+3x% twelve times on 15 enemies every 45 seconds, and a permanent
# 2x% chance of a meteorite worth 100+4x%. Both ends are GMS's own, stretched
# over 20 levels instead of 30.
#
# The meteorite falls on one enemy, like Blizzard's. GMS words only Blizzard's
# that way, but the two passives carry the same numbers to the digit, and read
# per enemy this one would pay fifteen times over on a full room.
